"""Original underground teaching mechanisms; project dossiers supply unique cases.
The public sources establish project context; these mechanisms are analytical models.
"""
C={}
def topic(key,title,anchor,mechanism,verify,failure,wrong,practice,model):
 C[key]=dict(title=title,anchor=anchor,mechanism=mechanism,verify=verify,failure=failure,misconception=wrong,practice=practice,model=model)
def parts(s):return s.split('~',1)
def pair(z,e):return z+'~'+e

topic('route','服務邊界與路線代價~Service boundaries and alignment cost','路線里程與端點~Alignment chainage and endpoints',
'隧道選線同時改變洞口、覆土與縱坡，短路線不保證低地質風險。比較方案必須使用相同起訖點，並分開主孔、引道及服務坑的工程數量；交通時間只是需求的一個指標，不能代替施工可達性或長期維修評估。~Alignment changes portals, cover and gradient together, so a shorter tunnel need not have lower geological risk. Compare options between identical endpoints and distinguish running bores, approaches and service galleries. Travel time measures one service benefit but cannot replace assessment of construction access, maintenance closures or exposure to uncertain ground.',
'把縱斷面、地形與地質剖面疊合，以端點坐標獨立反算距離，再將主孔與支坑數量分開核對。~Overlay the longitudinal profile, terrain and geology; independently derive distances from endpoint coordinates and reconcile running-bore and gallery quantities separately.',
'混用全線與單孔長度會同時扭曲工程數量、行程及逃生距離，造成方案比較失去共同基準。~Mixing whole-route and single-bore lengths distorts quantities, journey time and escape distance, destroying the common basis of an option comparison.',
'最短的隧道路線一定也有最低施工與維護風險。~The shortest tunnel alignment necessarily has the lowest construction and maintenance risk.',
'在方案表中凍結起訖點、計量範圍及地質假設，任何改線都要同步更新高程、數量與服務情境，不能只替換總長。~Freeze endpoints, measurement scope and ground assumptions in the option register; realignment requires coordinated updates to elevations, quantities and service scenarios rather than replacing one length.', 'time')
topic('fault','破碎帶連通與預報更新~Fault connectivity and forecast updating','破碎帶連通性~Fault-zone connectivity',
'斷層帶可以含很硬的岩塊，但整體變形與湧水常由填充節理和連通裂隙控制。單一岩芯強度不能代表整個掌子面；超前鑽孔、出水變化與揭露地質須回饋同一里程模型，預報則應保留不同情境及其證據權重。~A fault zone may contain strong intact blocks while filled joints and connected fractures govern its bulk deformation and inflow. One core strength does not represent the entire face. Probe records, water response and exposed geology must update a common chainage model, preserving competing interpretations and their evidential weight rather than treating a forecast as certainty.',
'將岩心回收、裂隙方位與出水曲線按里程對齊，用未參與建模的孔段作交叉檢驗，檢查是否只擬合已知資料。~Align recovery, fracture orientation and inflow by chainage; test the interpretation against a withheld borehole interval to detect fitting only the known observations.',
'只用完整岩石強度會漏掉軟弱填充物，可能在看似堅硬的地層中出現收斂加快、支護過載或水量突增。~Intact strength alone misses weak infill, allowing accelerating convergence, support overload or sudden inflow in ground that superficially appears strong.',
'岩芯很硬就可以排除破碎帶變形與集中湧水。~Hard intact core excludes fault-zone deformation and concentrated inflow.',
'每次地質模型更新保留舊版與新增證據，差異由地質及支護設計者共同判讀，施工條件改變需重新確認核准範圍。~Retain previous interpretations and new evidence at every update; geology and support designers jointly interpret differences and reconfirm approved bounds when ground conditions change.', 'darcy')
topic('water','測壓水頭與襯砌外壓~Piezometric head and lining pressure','測壓水頭~Piezometric head',
'水壓取決於連通含水層的測壓水頭，不必等於地表或海面至洞頂的幾何深度。排水降低水壓卻可能增加有效應力與沉陷；停泵或排水堵塞後水頭又會回升，因此防水、排水及環境保水是互相制約的設計選擇。~Water pressure follows piezometric head in the connected aquifer, not automatically the geometric depth below ground or sea level. Drainage reduces pressure but can increase effective stress and settlement. Head may recover after a pump outage or blockage, coupling waterproofing, drainage capacity and preservation of surrounding groundwater in the permanent design.',
'使用分層測壓管及流量計，配合降雨或潮位序列分辨補注與設備影響，將讀值統一換算至同一高程基準。~Use nested piezometers and flowmeters with rainfall or tide histories to distinguish recharge from equipment effects, converting observations to a common elevation datum.',
'將暫時降水後的低水頭當成永久狀態，會漏掉停泵後外壓回升；過度排水也可能引起周邊地層壓密。~Treating temporarily lowered head as permanent misses pressure recovery after outage; excessive drainage can also consolidate surrounding ground.',
'目前沒有可見漏水就能在設計中忽略外水壓。~No visible leakage means that external water pressure can be omitted from design.',
'設計檢核應分列正常排水、堵塞與停電水位，將環境受體的容許變化和監測責任一起交付，不把抽水量當唯一指標。~Separate normal drainage, blocked-drain and power-outage heads and hand over receptor limits and monitoring responsibility together rather than using pump flow as the sole indicator.', 'head')
topic('stress','覆土應力與洞壁重分配~Cover stress and wall redistribution','洞壁切向應力~Tangential wall stress',
'開挖使岩體洞壁失去徑向拘束，遠場荷載轉移到周圍岩體，局部切向應力可能升高。圓孔彈性解可辨識量級，但節理、非圓斷面、塑性區與原位應力比會改變峰值位置，不能只用覆土重量推定全部三維應力。~Excavation removes radial confinement at the wall and transfers load through the surrounding rock, potentially raising local tangential stress. An elastic circular-hole solution identifies scale, but joints, noncircular geometry, yielding and the in-situ stress ratio alter the peak location. Cover weight alone cannot establish the complete three-dimensional stress state or support demand.',
'將原位應力量測、岩石試驗及洞壁破壞方位相互比較，再用多點伸長計檢查變形是否與所假設應力方向一致。~Compare in-situ stress measurements, rock tests and wall-damage orientation, then use multipoint extensometers to test consistency with the assumed stress directions.',
'把彈性峰值直接當岩體強度可能誤判支護需求；相反地忽略剝落或擠壓也會讓局部破壞逐步侵入淨空。~Equating an elastic peak with rock-mass strength misjudges support demand; overlooking spalling or squeezing lets damage progressively consume clearance.',
'知道覆土深度就能唯一決定洞壁各方向的應力。~Cover depth uniquely determines wall stress in every direction.',
'保留應力模型的座標、邊界和材料假設，量測與預測不符時先核對代表性，再由岩力設計者選擇非線性或節理模型。~Record stress-model coordinates, boundaries and material assumptions; when observations disagree, check representativeness before the rock designer selects nonlinear or jointed models.', 'stress')
topic('support','支護啟動與變形容量~Support activation and deformation capacity','支護安裝時點~Support activation time',
'支護荷載由開挖釋放量和支護啟動時間共同決定，越早安裝不一定讓構件受力越小。地盤反力與支護曲線必須連同掌子面距離及封閉順序理解；擠壓性地層還需保留變形容量，不能只追求高剛度與高材料強度。~Support load depends on stress release and activation time, so earlier installation does not necessarily reduce member forces. Interpret ground-reaction and support curves together with distance from the face and closure sequence. Squeezing ground also needs deformation capacity; high stiffness and material strength alone do not guarantee a compatible support response.',
'同步記錄收斂、支護荷重與安裝里程，比較同一地質分區內的速率及荷載，不將不同開挖齡期讀值直接混合。~Synchronise convergence, support loads and installation chainage; compare rates and loads within one ground domain without mixing readings at different excavation ages.',
'過晚封閉會讓不可回復變形增加，過硬且行程不足的支護也可能脆裂，兩者都可能表現為裂縫而需不同處理。~Late closure increases irreversible movement, while excessively stiff support with little travel can fail brittly; both produce cracks but require different diagnoses.',
'支護越厚越硬就一定能解決所有擠壓性地層。~Thicker and stiffer support necessarily solves every squeezing-ground problem.',
'把安裝時間和量測資料一起交付支護設計者，任何級別變更都需地質及位移證據，不能憑單一瞬間讀值自行改支護。~Submit installation times with measurements to the support designer; class changes need both ground and movement evidence, not an isolated instantaneous reading.', 'spring')
topic('lining','環向受力與接縫柔度~Ring force and joint flexibility','襯砌環向壓縮~Lining hoop compression',
'圓形襯砌對均勻外壓可主要以環向壓縮抵抗，但接頭轉動、偏壓與背填空隙會引起彎矩。薄環膜應力只說明其中一條受力路徑；脫模、運輸、頂推及永久狀態的荷載不同，環片局部接觸與止水條件必須另外檢核。~A circular lining resists uniform external pressure largely through hoop compression, but joint rotation, uneven load and backfill voids generate bending. Thin-ring membrane stress describes only one load path. Demoulding, transport, jacking and permanent states impose different actions, requiring separate checks of local segment contact and sealing rather than one permanent-load calculation.',
'將環形變形、接縫張開與應變和含接頭彈簧的模型比較，分開安裝後、背填後及水頭回升後的基準。~Compare ring distortion, joint opening and strain with a joint-spring model, separating baselines after installation, grouting and head recovery.',
'局部脫空增加環片彎曲，裂縫未必代表混凝土平均強度不足；忽略接縫接觸會把補強方向導向錯誤位置。~Local voids increase bending, so cracks need not indicate inadequate mean concrete strength; neglecting joint contact can misdirect strengthening.',
'混凝土強度達標就不必檢查接縫轉動與偏壓。~Passing concrete strength eliminates the need to check joint rotation and uneven pressure.',
'設計圖應分開標註各施工階段、接頭剛度及背填條件，構件驗收同時核對幾何、材料批次與止水試驗適用包絡。~Drawings distinguish stages, joint stiffness and backfill conditions; component acceptance reconciles geometry, material batches and the applicable sealing-test envelope.', 'ring')
topic('seal','接頭壓縮與水密包絡~Joint compression and sealing envelope','止水壓縮餘量~Gasket compression reserve',
'止水條依受控壓縮維持連續接觸，接縫轉角、錯台、污染與材料鬆弛都會降低最不利點的接觸能力。平均壓縮量不能掩蓋局部脫離；全尺寸試驗的結果只對測試過的幾何、水壓及荷載歷程有效，幾何餘量本身並不是接觸壓力。~A gasket seals through controlled continuous compression; rotation, offset, contamination and relaxation reduce contact at the weakest point. Average compression cannot compensate for local separation. Full-size test results apply only to their tested geometry, head and load history, while a calculated geometric reserve is neither contact pressure nor evidence of watertightness.',
'全尺寸接頭試驗分別改變張開、錯台與外水壓，記錄漏水起點與卸載後殘餘位移，對照材料批次及溫度。~Vary opening, offset and pressure in full-size joint tests, recording leakage onset and residual movement against material batch and temperature.',
'扭曲或沾污的止水條可形成旁通通道，即使平均縫寬合格仍可能漏水；盲目灌漿也可能只轉移出水位置。~A twisted or contaminated gasket creates bypass leakage despite acceptable mean width; indiscriminate grouting may merely move the outlet.',
'接縫平均寬度合格就不必量測局部錯台及扭轉。~An acceptable average joint width makes local offset and twist measurements unnecessary.',
'保存接縫幾何與試驗壓力的配對紀錄，由設計者核定允收包絡；驗收時不能把課堂的幾何餘量當產品認證數字。~Retain paired joint geometry and test pressure, with the designer approving the acceptance envelope; classroom geometric reserves are not product certification values.', 'joint')
topic('tbm','掘進利用率與設備停時~Boring utilisation and equipment downtime','有效掘進利用率~Effective boring utilisation',
'TBM瞬時貫入率只描述刀盤切削的一段時間，拼裝、換刀、出渣與維修決定每天真正進尺。岩石強度與磨蝕性對刀具的影響不同，混合掌子面又產生不對稱作用；比較機器績效須按地質分區和停時原因分類，不能只排序最高進尺。~Instantaneous penetration describes only active cutting; erection, cutter changes, muck handling and repairs determine daily advance. Strength and abrasivity affect cutters differently, while mixed faces impose asymmetric loading. Compare performance by ground domain and downtime cause, because the highest short-duration penetration rate can coexist with poor daily production and increased maintenance demand.',
'由時間戳分離切削、拼裝與故障，將刀具位置、磨耗量及推力扭矩對齊里程，檢查停時是否集中在特定地層。~Separate cutting, erection and faults by timestamp; align cutter position, wear, thrust and torque with chainage and test clustering by ground type.',
'只提高瞬時進尺可能使出渣或刀具超出有效工況，短暫改善後增加停機，平均進尺和零件壽命反而下降。~Higher instantaneous advance can overload cutters or muck transport and create longer stoppages that reduce average progress and component life.',
'刀盤瞬間轉得更快就保證全工程平均進尺更高。~A faster instantaneous cutterhead speed guarantees higher project-average advance.',
'停機紀錄使用可追溯原因碼，把地質變化與設備故障分開統計，參數調整只能在設備和施工團隊核准程序內進行。~Use traceable downtime codes, separating geological change from equipment faults; parameter changes stay within procedures approved by equipment and construction teams.', 'advance')
topic('logistics','共享通道與運輸瓶頸~Shared access and transport bottlenecks','出渣運輸節拍~Muck-transport cycle',
'多工作面只有在供電、通風、出渣與材料供應同步充足時才增加總產量。共用豎井或軌道形成串聯瓶頸，排隊和維修窗口會降低名目容量；緩衝區太大又可能侵占通行與救援空間，因此不能單純把各面產能相加。~Multiple headings increase output only when power, air, muck transport and materials support them together. Shared shafts or railways become serial bottlenecks, while queues and maintenance reduce nominal capacity. Large buffers may obstruct personnel and rescue access, so face capacities cannot simply be added without a network-level transport and storage check.',
'以裝載質量、往返時間及排隊時間重建物流曲線，再核對緩衝占用、共用通道優先權與維修時段。~Reconstruct flow from payload, round-trip and queue times, then check buffer occupancy, shared-route priorities and maintenance periods.',
'把理想往返時間當全天常數會忽略交會等待與卸料堵塞，導致工作面停工或把材料堆入必要通道。~Treating an ideal cycle as constant all day misses passing delays and unloading blockages, stopping headings or pushing material into essential access space.',
'增加工作面就可以直接把各面的理論產量相加。~Adding headings allows their theoretical outputs to be summed directly.',
'每日排程同時標示人員、材料和維修的占用時段，任何物流改線先檢查通風與應變通道，不能只看運量提升。~Schedules show personnel, materials and maintenance occupancy together; rerouting first checks ventilation and emergency access rather than only throughput gains.', 'logistics')
topic('survey','控制網與貫通誤差~Control network and breakthrough error','方向角誤差~Orientation error',
'長隧道的微小方向誤差會沿距離累積，地下控制網又缺少直接衛星定位，必須把地表基準可靠傳到洞內。閉合差很小不代表無系統誤差；尺度、折光、儀器定向與高程基準可能共同偏移，誤差相關性也使平方和估算失真。~Small orientation errors accumulate over long drives, while underground networks lack direct satellite positioning and depend on transferring surface control. A small closure does not exclude systematic bias: scale, refraction, orientation and vertical datum may shift together. Correlated errors also invalidate a naive root-sum-square combination of supposedly independent observations.',
'由獨立測量組複核地表到洞內的轉換，保留原始角距及溫度資料，用不同控制線比較方向與高程偏差。~Independently check surface-to-tunnel transformations, retain raw angles, distances and temperatures, and compare orientation and elevation through separate control routes.',
'共用錯誤基準可能讓兩組測量同時看似一致，直到貫通或軌道銜接才發現系統偏差，修正成本遠高於早期複核。~A shared wrong datum can make separate surveys appear consistent until breakthrough or track connection exposes bias that is costly to correct.',
'兩次閉合結果一致就能證明地下控制網沒有系統誤差。~Two matching closures prove that an underground network has no systematic error.',
'貫通前凍結座標、尺度與高程版本，獨立組直接使用原始觀測重算；不得只傳遞整理好的坐標而遺失校正資訊。~Freeze coordinate, scale and height revisions before breakthrough; independent reviewers recompute raw observations rather than receiving only adjusted coordinates without corrections.', 'angle')
topic('ventilation','通風網路與壓力損失~Ventilation network and pressure loss','風道摩擦壓損~Duct friction loss',
'風機提供壓差，實際風量由風道摩阻、局部損失、外風與其他風機共同決定。支路開關會重新分配整個網路，不能把額定風量直接加總；正常污染稀釋與火災控煙也有不同目標，需要分別建立受控邊界和故障情境。~Fans supply pressure, but actual flow follows friction, local losses, external wind and interactions with other fans. Switching a branch redistributes the network rather than simply adding rated flows. Routine dilution and fire smoke control have different objectives, so each needs explicit boundaries, operating states and failure cases rather than one universal flow target.',
'沿線同步量測靜壓與風速，記錄風門及其他風機狀態，再把實測工作點和風機曲線、網路壓損比較。~Measure pressure and velocity synchronously, record dampers and other fans, and compare the measured duty point with fan curves and network resistance.',
'只看風機轉速會漏掉風門誤位或短路漏風，可能在總耗電增加時，真正需要的區段反而風量不足。~Fan speed alone misses a misplaced damper or leakage shortcut; total power may rise while the critical section receives less air.',
'風機銘牌風量相加就是全隧道各處可用的通風量。~Adding fan nameplate flows gives the usable airflow everywhere in the tunnel.',
'驗收採明確風門和車流邊界，維修改線後重新核對網路工作點，火災模式由防災責任工程師簽認而非沿用正常模式。~Commission with specified damper and traffic boundaries, recheck duty points after rerouting, and have the fire-safety engineer approve emergency modes independently.', 'friction')
topic('cooling','熱源分配與空氣顯熱~Heat sources and sensible-air removal','通風顯熱量~Ventilation sensible heat',
'深部岩體、列車和機械會向空氣持續放熱，空氣帶走的顯熱由質量流量與溫升決定。相同體積風量在不同密度下不具有相同散熱能力；濕度、岩體瞬變及水冷系統還需分開記帳，單一穩態熱平衡不能預測全部溫度尖峰。~Deep rock, trains and machinery release heat to the air, whose sensible removal depends on mass flow and temperature rise. Equal volumetric flow at different density does not provide equal cooling. Moisture, transient rock heat and water cooling need separate accounts; a steady balance cannot predict every temperature peak or local worker exposure.',
'同步量測進出口溫濕度、風量及設備負載，分開平均與尖峰時段，用能量收支殘差檢查漏列熱源。~Synchronise inlet/outlet temperature, humidity, flow and equipment load, separate average and peak periods, and use energy residuals to identify missing sources.',
'把低密度空氣視為海平面空氣會高估散熱，局部熱點也可能被斷面平均溫度掩蓋，導致設備或工作環境超限。~Assuming sea-level density overstates cooling at low density, while cross-sectional averages hide hot spots affecting equipment and the work environment.',
'只要體積風量相同，不同海拔的空氣散熱量一定相同。~Equal volumetric airflow provides identical cooling at every altitude.',
'熱帳分別列岩體、交通、機械與水冷路徑，交接時保存季節和負載範圍，設備增設前須重新核對可用散熱能力。~Keep rock, traffic, machinery and water-cooling paths separate; retain seasonal and load ranges and reassess cooling capacity before adding equipment.', 'heat')
topic('wave','列車壓力波與動壓量級~Train pressure waves and dynamic-pressure scale','入口壓力擾動~Portal pressure disturbance',
'列車進洞壓縮前方空氣，波動在洞口、橫通道和斷面變化處傳播與反射。速度和阻塞比影響壓力量級，但不可壓動壓只是比較尺度，不能替代可壓縮瞬變計算；兩車交會、門位與列車外形都可能改變乘客及設備的壓力歷程。~A train entering a tunnel compresses the air ahead, producing waves reflected at portals, passages and section changes. Speed and blockage influence magnitude, but incompressible dynamic pressure is only a comparison scale, not a compressible transient solution. Train encounters, door states and vehicle shape change the pressure histories experienced by passengers and equipment.',
'以相同列車編組、速度和門位量測多點壓力歷程，檢查峰值、上升時間及反射抵達時刻，而不只比較一個最大值。~Measure pressure histories at several points with matching train formation, speed and door states, comparing rise time and reflection arrival as well as peaks.',
'以單一動壓數字當允收值會漏掉壓力梯度與反射疊加，可能使門扇、密封或乘客舒適度需求被低估。~Using one dynamic-pressure value for acceptance misses gradients and superposed reflections, understating demands on doors, seals or passenger comfort.',
'動壓公式算出的數值就是長鐵路隧道完整壓力波。~A dynamic-pressure calculation is the complete pressure-wave prediction for a long rail tunnel.',
'試車報告記錄編組、速度、溫度及門位版本，土建斷面變更與設備耐壓驗證共用同一氣動模型，不能各自選有利情境。~Trial reports retain formation, speed, temperature and door revisions; civil changes and equipment-pressure checks share one aerodynamic model rather than selectively favourable cases.', 'dynamic')
topic('drain','停泵緩衝與有效集水容積~Outage buffer and effective sump volume','剩餘集水容積~Remaining sump volume',
'集水坑在泵停止後提供有限緩衝，剩餘容積需扣除初始水量、沉積及不可用死角。緩衝時間取決於淨入流，不是名牌抽水能力；警報延遲、備援切換與水量突增會消耗餘裕，排水電力又可能與其他安全設備共用失效原因。~A sump offers finite buffering after pumps stop, with usable volume reduced by initial water, sediment and dead spaces. Buffer time depends on net inflow rather than pump nameplate capacity. Alarm delay, transfer time and inflow surges consume reserve, while shared electrical dependencies may disable drainage and other safety equipment together.',
'以水位容積曲線和流量計核對停泵水位上升率，另檢查淤積、警報時間戳及備援電力切換紀錄。~Compare outage level-rise rate with the level-volume curve and flowmeter, separately checking sediment, alarm timestamps and backup-power transfer records.',
'未扣除沉積的總容積會高估反應時間，若警報與抽水同失電，操作者可能在緩衝已耗盡後才得知水位上升。~Gross volume without sediment deduction overstates response time; shared loss of alarm and pumping power can hide rising water until the buffer is exhausted.',
'集水坑總容積除以平均入流就是保證可用的反應時間。~Gross sump volume divided by average inflow is a guaranteed response time.',
'交接有效容積、初始水位及延遲預算，由排水與電氣責任人共同核對故障情境，定期清淤後保存量測證據。~Handover usable volume, initial level and delay budgets; drainage and electrical owners jointly review failures and retain measurements after sediment removal.', 'sump')
topic('escape','疏散時間與分區可用性~Evacuation time and zone availability','所需疏散時間~Required evacuation time',
'疏散時間包含辨識、反應、移動及排隊，不只由出口距離決定。人員速度會受煙熱、能見度及行動能力影響，安全判斷還要比較可用安全時間；橫通道存在但門或鄰孔不可用時，圖上的最短路線不一定能作實際選擇。~Evacuation includes detection, response, travel and queues, not merely distance to an exit. Smoke, visibility and mobility alter walking speed, while safety requires comparison with available safe time. A passage shown on a plan may be unusable because its door or receiving bore is unavailable, invalidating the nominal shortest route.',
'以人流模擬或受控演練分辨前置時間、行走與門口排隊，核對每個出口接收區的可用狀態及通訊紀錄。~Separate pre-movement, travel and doorway queues through simulation or controlled drills, checking receiving-zone availability and communication records for each exit.',
'以最快成人速度套全部旅客會低估需求，若忽略接收孔受煙或車流影響，疏散可能移到另一個危險邊界。~Applying the fastest adult speed to everyone understates demand; overlooking smoke or traffic in the receiving bore can transfer evacuees into another hazard.',
'只要出口距離短，就不需要比較可用與所需安全時間。~Short exit distance removes the need to compare available and required safe time.',
'疏散模型保留人口、速度分布及出口狀態，演練改動由營運與防災責任者批准，教材算例不得當作現場指揮程序。~Retain population, speed distribution and exit states; operations and fire-safety owners approve drill changes, and classroom calculations are not incident-command procedures.', 'escape')
topic('reliability','設備備援與共同失效~Equipment redundancy and common failure','系統不可用率~System unavailability',
'兩套設備只有在故障近似獨立且切換可靠時，並聯才顯著降低不可用率。共用配電、控制軟體、冷卻或受淹位置會把獨立假設破壞；維修停用也改變當下配置，因此可靠度模型必須明列共有資源和設備狀態，不能只數備用台數。~Parallel equipment sharply reduces unavailability only when failures are approximately independent and transfer works. Shared power, software, cooling or flood exposure breaks that assumption. Planned maintenance also changes the available configuration, so reliability models must identify shared resources and states rather than count spare units or multiply unsupported independent probabilities.',
'由設備清單畫出故障樹，將電源、控制及實體位置追到共同節點，並用事件及維修紀錄檢查獨立假設。~Build a fault tree from the asset list, trace power, control and location to shared nodes, and test independence against incident and maintenance records.',
'重複安裝卻共用單一供電可能在一次故障中全部停機，帳面可靠度很高但實際不可用時間沒有降低。~Duplicated equipment on one supply can fail together in a single event, leaving actual downtime unchanged despite optimistic calculated reliability.',
'設備有兩台就可以直接把各自故障率相乘判定安全。~Two units allow their failure probabilities to be multiplied directly to establish safety.',
'維修計畫附當日可用配置與剩餘備援，任何共同資源更動同步更新故障樹，切換試驗由設備及營運團隊共同見證。~Attach the actual configuration and remaining redundancy to maintenance plans, update fault trees after shared-resource changes, and witness transfer tests jointly.', 'reliability')
topic('asset','資產編碼與可追溯交接~Asset identity and traceable handover','資產資料完整度~Asset-record completeness',
'地下設備的竣工資料必須讓維護人員找到正確位置、材料批次和控制版本。只有上傳圖面而沒有變更歷程，無法分辨元件替換與真正劣化；告警、儀器、線路及工單使用一致識別碼，才可能把量測趨勢連回實際受力或水力系統。~Handover must let maintainers find the correct location, material batch and control revision. Drawings without change history cannot distinguish replacement from deterioration. Consistent identifiers across alarms, instruments, circuits and work orders are essential for linking trends to the physical structural or hydraulic system instead of treating each record as an isolated file.',
'抽取一條告警，從控制畫面追到設備、線路、圖面和工單，核對位置、版本及校正日期並記錄無法閉合的欄位。~Trace a sampled alarm from screen to equipment, circuit, drawing and work order, checking location, revision and calibration dates and recording broken links.',
'設備改名卻未更新控制畫面會引導人員隔離錯誤回路，材料批次缺漏則使同批缺陷無法追蹤到其他位置。~Renaming an asset without updating the screen can isolate the wrong circuit; missing material batches prevent tracing related defects at other locations.',
'全部檔案上傳完成就代表工程交接已經驗收合格。~Uploading all files means that engineering handover has been accepted.',
'交接以可完成的定位、查找與復原任務驗證，由維護責任人確認現場可用性；完整度只是資料指標，不代表結構安全或設備可靠。~Validate handover through achievable location, retrieval and recovery tasks witnessed by maintainers; completeness measures records, not structural safety or equipment reliability.', 'coverage')
topic('rail','基線縱坡與牽引需求~Base-alignment grade and traction demand','坡度阻力功率~Grade-resistance power',
'基線鐵路用較小縱坡降低重載列車的重力阻力，但仍有滾動、空氣阻力及加速需求。土建線形和供電容量必須使用同一列車與速度情境，短距陡坡也不能被平均坡度掩蓋；制動方向的能量處理則是另一個需要獨立檢核的工況。~A base alignment reduces heavy-train gravity resistance through gentler gradients, but rolling resistance, aerodynamic drag and acceleration remain. Civil geometry and power capacity must use consistent train and speed cases. Short steep sections cannot be hidden in an average gradient, while braking energy in the opposite direction requires its own operating and electrical assessment.',
'以里程高程表逐段計算坡度，對照列車性能曲線和供電模型，另檢核低速牽引及下坡制動，不只比較平均功率。~Calculate local grades from chainage and elevation, compare with train-performance and power models, and separately check low-speed traction and downhill braking.',
'平均坡度低卻存在短陡坡時，峰值功率可能超過預估，速度下降又會增加區段占用時間，牽連營運容量。~A short steep grade can exceed power estimates despite a low average, reducing speed and extending block occupation with capacity consequences.',
'基線隧道坡度很小，所以不必做牽引與制動分析。~A small base-tunnel gradient eliminates the need for traction and braking analysis.',
'軌頂高程交付前，由土建、軌道、供電和營運共同確認同版線形及列車包絡，變更坡度時同步更新性能與容量計算。~Civil, track, power and operations teams approve one alignment and train envelope before handover; grade changes update both performance and capacity calculations.', 'grade')
topic('headway','單線瓶頸與時距容量~Single-track bottlenecks and headway capacity','區段占用時間~Section occupation time',
'一段單線或共用道岔會把連續鐵路變成受時間窗限制的系統，清空時間與衝突進路和列車行走時間同樣重要。單方向理論容量只提供上界比較；雙向交會、延誤傳播及維修封鎖會改變可實現班次，必須在共同時距圖中檢查。~A single-track section or shared turnout creates time-window constraints, making clearance and conflicting routes as important as travel time. One-direction theoretical capacity gives only a comparison bound. Opposing movements, propagated delays and maintenance closures alter achievable service and must be examined together on a common timetable diagram.',
'從列車通過與路線釋放時間戳重建占用，對照進路衝突表，再測試一班延誤如何影響後續交會而非只看平均準點。~Reconstruct occupation from passage and release timestamps, compare the route-conflict table and test how one delay affects subsequent meets.',
'把清空時間省略或把雙向列車當同方向排列會高估容量，實際服務可能需要長時間等待才能保留安全間隔。~Omitting clearance or treating opposing trains as one-direction traffic overstates capacity and requires long real waits to preserve separation.',
'單向理論列車數可以直接當作雙向可承諾營運容量。~One-direction theoretical train count can be promised as two-way operational capacity.',
'容量報告附衝突進路、列車性能和維修窗，任何新增班次須由營運方用可重播的時距圖驗證，不只比較單一每小時數字。~Capacity reports include conflicting routes, train performance and maintenance windows; operations validates additions with replayable timetables rather than one hourly figure.', 'headway')
topic('thermal','溫度拘束與構件裂縫~Thermal restraint and component cracking','拘束溫度應變~Restrained thermal strain',
'厚壁構件在水化升溫後冷卻，若相鄰構件或基座限制收縮，熱應變會轉為拉應力。抗壓強度達標不等於抗裂合格，因為彈性模數成熟、徐變、溫度梯度與澆置順序都影響實際拘束；完全拘束彈性估算只能當量級上限比較。~A thick element cools after hydration, and restraint from adjacent pours or its base converts contraction into tension. Compressive-strength compliance does not establish crack resistance because modulus development, creep, gradients and pour sequence influence restraint. A fully restrained elastic estimate is therefore a scale bound, not a prediction of actual cracking or residual stress.',
'記錄核心表面溫度及同條件試體成熟度，將裂縫位置與溫差、拆模及鄰段澆置時間配對，檢查熱歷程是否被遺漏。~Record core/surface temperature and matched-cured maturity, pairing cracks with temperature differences, formwork removal and adjacent pours to identify missing thermal history.',
'標準養護試體合格而現場過早冷卻，仍可能形成貫穿裂縫並影響止水；僅增加後續抗壓試驗無法重建失去的養護。~Passing standard-cured specimens does not prevent through-cracking after rapid cooling, and more later strength tests cannot reconstruct inadequate curing.',
'混凝土抗壓強度合格就代表厚壁構件不會產生熱裂縫。~Adequate compressive strength proves that thick concrete cannot develop thermal cracks.',
'澆置前核准溫度監測及養護方案，變更材料、拆模或澆置順序時重新檢查熱分析，將裂縫與接縫止水的責任一併交付。~Approve monitoring and curing before pours, revisit thermal analysis after material or sequence changes, and hand over crack and waterstop responsibilities together.', 'thermal')
topic('grout','背填連續性與體積帳~Backfill continuity and volume balance','襯砌背後幾何空隙~Geometric lining annulus',
'盾尾空隙須由背填恢復襯砌與地層的接觸，但幾何空隙不是必然注入量。超挖、地層吸收、回流和材料體積變化都會改變收支；注入量達到目標仍不代表每個位置填滿，需要把壓力、時間與後續變形一起判讀。~Backfill restores contact across the shield-tail gap, but geometric void is not the required injected volume. Overbreak, absorption, return and material volume change alter the balance. Meeting a volume target does not prove complete spatial filling; pressure, timing and later deformation must be interpreted together rather than using a single total.',
'用環片及開挖尺寸計算幾何空隙，核對注入回流質量與時間戳，再以適當無損檢測及變形資料查局部缺填。~Calculate the annulus from lining and excavation dimensions, reconcile injected/returned mass and timing, then use suitable nondestructive and deformation evidence for local gaps.',
'局部通道讓材料回流時，總注量可能正常但背後仍有空洞，環片變形與接頭滲漏可能延後出現。~Preferential return paths can give normal total injection while leaving voids, with delayed segment distortion and leakage.',
'灌入體積等於理論空隙就能證明襯砌背後全部填滿。~Injected volume equal to the theoretical annulus proves complete filling behind the lining.',
'將每環幾何、材料批次及注入回流紀錄綁定，缺填診斷由土建及地工共同確認，後續處置不只追求增加總注量。~Link each ring to geometry, material batch and injection/return records; structural and ground teams diagnose gaps together rather than merely increasing volume.', 'void')
topic('convergence','位移速率與基準漂移~Movement rate and datum drift','量測區間平均速率~Interval-average movement rate',
'收斂讀值包含岩體反應、支護作用及量測系統本身的變化，兩次讀值差只能得到區間平均速率。基準點移動、溫度與觀測頻率都會改變判讀；判定加速或趨穩時，需要多個獨立位置和同一施工時間軸，不以單點曲線取代整個斷面。~Convergence combines ground response, support action and measurement-system changes. Two readings yield only an interval-average rate. Datum motion, temperature and sampling frequency affect interpretation, so acceleration or stabilisation needs independent locations and a common construction timeline rather than one point standing for the entire section or an unobserved short-duration peak.',
'同時檢查基準點穩定、儀器重複性及多點位移，將開挖步距和溫度加進趨勢圖，對異常先做獨立重測。~Check datum stability, repeatability and multiple movement points together, adding excavation steps and temperature to trends and independently repeating anomalies.',
'量測點被換位置而延用舊零點可製造假加速，反過來重設零點不保留舊值又會掩蓋持續累積變形。~Relocation with an old zero creates false acceleration, while resetting without preserving history hides cumulative deformation.',
'兩次讀值的平均速率就是期間內任何時刻的最大速率。~The average between two readings is the maximum rate at every time in the interval.',
'基準或儀器改動保留前後重疊讀值，警戒條件由責任工程師按量測能力核准，異常處置前先確認資料可比性。~Retain overlapping readings across datum or instrument changes; the responsible engineer approves triggers against measurement capability and verifies comparability before intervention.', 'rate')
topic('box','矩形沉管的框架受力~Rectangular immersed-box frame action','頂板跨中彎矩~Roof-span bending',
'矩形沉管的頂板、側牆與中牆透過框架連續性傳遞水土壓力，不能套圓形薄環的膜應力。單向簡支條帶只能估計局部彎矩量級；施工浮運、落底、回填和使用期的邊界不同，支承沉陷、接頭剪力及裂縫寬度仍須分階段檢核。~A rectangular immersed tube transfers water and earth pressure through roof, walls and internal partitions acting as a frame. A circular thin-ring membrane formula is inappropriate. A simply supported strip estimates one bending scale only; flotation, placement, backfill and service change the restraints, requiring staged checks of settlement, joint shear and cracking.',
'比對頂板及中牆應變，使用含支承剛度的框架模型核對彎矩分配，將落底前後量測分開。~Compare roof and partition strain with a frame model including support stiffness, keeping measurements before and after bedding separate.',
'忽略中牆支承或不均勻底床會錯估正負彎矩，局部裂縫可能是邊界變化而非材料強度不足。~Omitting partition support or uneven bedding misallocates positive and negative moments; local cracking may reflect changed restraints rather than weak material.',
'矩形沉管可以直接使用圓環均勻外壓公式設計。~A rectangular immersed tube can be designed directly with a circular-ring pressure formula.',
'把單條帶、整體框架及接頭模型分開提交，標註適用施工階段和受力方向，保留裂縫及水密試驗的獨立判定。~Submit strip, whole-frame and joint models separately, identifying stage and load direction while retaining independent cracking and watertightness assessments.','beam')
topic('buoyancy','浮運重量帳與姿態穩定~Tow-out mass balance and stability','剩餘浮力~Residual buoyancy',
'浮力由排開水體重量決定，總質量還包含設備、臨時封端及艙內液體。重量帳只能判定淨垂直力，不能證明浮運穩定；壓載液自由表面、重心位置、拖纜與波浪都會改變傾斜反應，落底接觸亦需另建模型。~Buoyancy equals displaced water weight, while total mass includes equipment, temporary bulkheads and liquid contents. A mass balance determines net vertical force but does not establish towing stability. Ballast free surfaces, centre of gravity, tow lines and waves affect heel response, and initial contact with the bed needs another model.',
'以實際重量清冊和吃水測量互核，量測液艙水位及橫傾，檢查密度與體積是否採同一狀態。~Reconcile an itemised mass register with draught measurements, tank levels and heel, checking that density and displaced volume describe the same state.',
'漏列臨時設備或自由液面會使浮力帳看似足夠卻缺乏回正能力，偏載也可能先造成局部接觸。~Missing temporary equipment or free-surface effects can leave an apparently adequate buoyancy balance with insufficient restoring capacity and premature local contact.',
'剩餘浮力為正就代表浮運姿態在所有波況穩定。~Positive residual buoyancy establishes stability in every sea state.',
'質量清冊每次變更都重新確認重心和吃水，操作窗口依核准海事方案及量測決定，不由本課靜力式制定。~Update centre of gravity and draught after every mass-register change; approved marine procedures and observations determine operating windows, not this static classroom equation.','float')
topic('bed','基床變形與接頭轉角~Bedding movement and joint rotation','差異沉陷梯度~Differential settlement gradient',
'沉管基床將箱體荷載傳給海床，局部沖刷、回填不均與軟弱層固結會改變接觸分布。總沉陷小不代表接頭轉角小；相鄰管節的差異位移和支承長度才控制局部變形，施工量測須保留時間與潮位基準。~The bed transfers tube load into the seabed, and scour, uneven backfill or consolidation alter contact. Small total settlement does not imply small joint rotation; differential movement and support length control local distortion. Construction observations must preserve time and tidal datum because immediate placement and delayed consolidation describe different mechanisms.',
'用管節水準網、海床剖面及孔壓變化交叉核對，將整體下沉與相鄰節轉角分開評估。~Cross-check tube levelling, seabed profiles and pore-pressure change, separating overall settlement from rotation between neighbouring elements.',
'只追蹤平均高程可能漏掉單側失去支承，接頭剪力與止水錯台會先於明顯整體下沉增加。~Mean elevation can conceal loss of support on one side, allowing joint shear and gasket offset to grow before obvious overall settlement.',
'各管節平均高程接近就能排除接頭差異變形。~Similar mean element elevations exclude differential movement at joints.',
'將基床施工紀錄與長期水準資料連結至管節編號，差異變形先查基準和孔壓，再由設計者判斷接觸及接頭。~Link bedding records and long-term levelling to element identifiers; check datum and pore pressure before designers interpret contact and joint behaviour.','settle')
topic('deck','內部樓板與荷載路徑~Internal decks and load paths','樓板條帶受彎~Deck-strip bending',
'雙層公路的樓板、或隧道內設備隔板，都把局部荷載傳給支承，但兩者功能與設計作用並不相同。簡支條帶可估計均載彎矩，集中輪載、剪力、疲勞與火災降強度必須另驗；幾何空間分層不能取代結構邊界的確認。~A double-deck road slab and an equipment partition both transfer local loads to supports but serve different functions and design actions. A simply supported strip estimates uniform-load bending. Concentrated wheel loads, shear, fatigue and fire-reduced strength require separate checks; dividing space geometrically does not establish the actual structural restraints.',
'核對支承位置、施工接縫及荷載分布，將實測撓度與分階段模型比較，分辨整體變形與支承滑移。~Check support positions, construction joints and load distribution; compare measured deflection with staged models to distinguish member bending from support slip.',
'把隔板誤當行車樓板會使用錯誤荷載，反之漏掉交通集中荷載則低估局部彎剪與疲勞。~Mistaking a partition for a roadway deck applies the wrong actions, while omitting concentrated traffic load underestimates local bending, shear and fatigue.',
'只要空間分成兩層就可以採用相同的樓板荷載。~Any space divided into two levels can use the same deck loading.',
'交付時明示樓板用途、支承及各施工階段，讓建築淨空、設備配置及結構假設在同一版本中核對。~State deck function, supports and construction stages at handover so clearance, equipment layout and structural assumptions can be reconciled in one revision.','beam')
topic('lighting','視覺適應與路面亮度~Visual adaptation and pavement luminance','漫反射亮度~Diffuse luminance',
'駕駛從洞外進入洞內時視覺適應需要時間，照度並不等同從駕駛視角看到的亮度。路面反射、濕度、燈具配光及背景對比共同影響辨識；朗伯模型只示範理想漫反射，不能直接制定入口段燈具間距或真實道路安全值。~Driver adaptation takes time when entering a tunnel, and illuminance is not the luminance seen from the driving position. Pavement reflection, wetness, luminaire distribution and background contrast affect detection. A Lambertian model illustrates ideal diffuse reflection only; it cannot establish entrance-zone spacing or actual road-safety limits without photometric and operational assessment.',
'以駕駛視角的亮度量測配合照度網格，分別檢查乾濕路面與燈具衰減，保留外部天空條件。~Combine driver-view luminance with illuminance grids, checking dry and wet pavement and lamp depreciation while preserving exterior sky conditions.',
'照度平均值合格仍可能存在低亮度障礙區或眩光，感測器沾污也會使調光系統低估外界亮度。~Acceptable average illuminance can coexist with dark obstacles or glare, while sensor contamination may bias adaptive lighting controls.',
'照度越高就必然使隧道內所有物體更容易辨識。~Higher illuminance necessarily makes every tunnel object easier to detect.',
'將視角、路面狀態和光度校正連同量測交付，照明調整需按核准場景測試，不把理想反射公式當驗收標準。~Hand over viewing geometry, pavement state and photometric calibration; test changes against approved scenarios rather than treating ideal reflection as an acceptance criterion.','lighting')
topic('corrosion','氯鹽遷移與耐久判讀~Chloride transport and durability interpretation','擴散特徵長度~Diffusion characteristic length',
'海水或除冰鹽可提供氯離子，材料孔隙與裂縫控制其傳輸；鋼筋腐蝕還需要局部電化學條件。平方根擴散長度僅顯示時間尺度，並不是腐蝕門檻深度；表面濃度變化、乾濕循環、結合效應及施工裂縫須另行辨識。~Seawater or deicing salt supplies chloride, while pores and cracks govern transport; reinforcement corrosion also depends on local electrochemical conditions. A square-root diffusion length indicates a time scale, not a corrosion-threshold depth. Surface concentration, wetting cycles, binding and construction cracks must be distinguished rather than hidden in one fitted diffusivity.',
'以分層取樣的氯鹽剖面配合裂縫圖與電位量測，檢查擴散模型是否只適用未開裂材料。~Combine depth-resolved chloride samples with crack maps and potential measurements, checking whether the diffusion model applies only to uncracked material.',
'把一次電位讀值當腐蝕速率會誤判剩餘壽命，裂縫快速傳輸也可能被平均材料係數掩蓋。~Treating one potential reading as corrosion rate misjudges remaining life, while averaged material coefficients conceal rapid crack transport.',
'擴散長度就是鋼筋開始腐蝕的位置和精確時間。~Diffusion length gives the exact location and time of corrosion initiation.',
'保留取樣深度、含水狀態及材料批次，用多種證據解釋劣化；維修優先序依構件功能與實際病害制定。~Retain sample depth, moisture and material batches and interpret deterioration using multiple evidence types; prioritise repairs by function and observed defects.','diffusion')
topic('environment','水量帳與環境受體~Water balance and environmental receptors','邊界水量差~Boundary water-balance residual',
'隧道排水可能改變泉水、溪流或地下水補注，但同時還有降雨、季節與既有抽水等影響。水量平衡需要明確時間和空間邊界，殘差不能直接歸因於某一裂隙；應用施工前基線和對照站區分自然變化與工程效應。~Tunnel drainage may alter springs, streams or groundwater recharge, alongside rainfall, seasonal change and existing abstraction. A water balance needs explicit temporal and spatial boundaries; its residual cannot be assigned directly to one fracture. Baseline observations and control locations help separate natural variability from construction effects rather than equating correlation with causation.',
'同步比較雨量、泉流、排水與對照井，核對儀器缺測和蓄水變化，對不同季節分別閉合水量帳。~Compare rainfall, spring flow, drainage and control wells, checking missing data and storage change and closing balances separately by season.',
'未量到的支流或時間錯位會產生假性水量損失，錯把所有減流歸於隧道可能導致無效補救。~Unmeasured tributaries or timing mismatch create false losses; attributing every decrease to the tunnel can prompt ineffective mitigation.',
'施工後泉水變少就能單獨證明隧道造成全部減流。~Reduced spring flow after construction alone proves the tunnel caused the entire change.',
'預先定義受體、基線及資料缺口，任何因果判斷都需列出替代解釋，補救效果也用同一監測邊界評估。~Define receptors, baselines and data gaps beforehand; causal judgements list alternatives, and mitigation is evaluated within the same monitoring boundary.','balance')
topic('hydraulic','輸水摩阻與瞬變邊界~Conveyance friction and transient boundaries','滿管沿程損失~Full-pipe friction loss',
'輸水隧道由上下游能量差驅動，沿程粗糙度、接頭及局部收縮消耗水頭；流速增加使摩阻快速上升。穩態滿管式不能描述水錘、自由水面轉換或氣囊，閘門動作和停機歷程必須另外建立瞬變模型與通氣條件。~A conveyance tunnel is driven by upstream and downstream energy levels; roughness, joints and contractions consume head, with friction rising rapidly with velocity. A steady full-pipe equation does not describe water hammer, free-surface transitions or trapped air. Gate movements and shutdown histories require separate transient modelling and explicit ventilation conditions.',
'以同步上下游水位和流量核對能量坡度，分辨入口損失與沿程損失，保留閘門及氣壓狀態。~Use synchronised levels and flow to check energy gradient, separate entrance from distributed losses and preserve gate and air-pressure states.',
'把閘門急動後的壓力峰當穩態摩阻，會錯估粗糙度並漏掉瞬變作用；未排出的氣囊也會改變有效斷面。~Treating post-gate pressure peaks as steady friction biases roughness and misses transients; trapped air also changes effective area.',
'只算穩態流量就能排除輸水隧道的水錘與氣囊。~A steady-flow calculation excludes water hammer and trapped air in a conveyance tunnel.',
'水理交付需包含水位基準、流量、閘門歷程及模型適用狀態；瞬變與通氣由水理設計者另行檢核。~Hydraulic handover includes level datum, flow, gate histories and model regimes; specialists independently assess transients and air movement.','waterfriction')
topic('waterroute','地下水路與傳遞時間~Underground water routes and travel time','水體平流時間~Water advection time',
'地下排水或引水設施的路線先由集水區、入流點、出口水位及坡度定義，不能以交通旅行時間衡量。定速水體的行程可用距離除速度估算，但洪峰波速、蓄水與回水會改變訊號傳遞；各支路必須在共同水位與時間基準下連接。~An underground water route is defined by catchments, inflows, outfall level and gradient, not vehicle journey time. Distance divided by velocity estimates constant-speed material travel, while flood-wave celerity, storage and backwater alter signal propagation. Branches must be connected using common level and time references before interpreting arrival or control response.',
'對齊入口與出口水位流量時間序列，利用允許的示蹤或模型比較平流時間與洪峰時差，保留回水條件。~Align inlet and outlet level-flow histories; use permitted tracer data or modelling to distinguish material travel from peak lag while preserving backwater conditions.',
'把平流時間當洪峰預警時間會忽略波速和支路入流，控制指令可能在假定水體到達之前已失去適用性。~Using advection time as flood-warning time ignores celerity and side inflows, allowing control assumptions to fail before the assumed arrival.',
'水體流過全程的時間必然等於洪峰抵達的時間。~Material travel time necessarily equals flood-peak arrival time.',
'路線圖同時標示水位基準、支路與控制邊界，所有時間比較註明是物質、波峰或設備延遲，避免混用。~Route diagrams show level datum, branches and control boundaries; label each time as material travel, wave propagation or equipment delay.','advection')
topic('storage','洪水歷線與調蓄餘量~Flood hydrographs and storage reserve','淨入流調蓄量~Net-inflow storage',
'調蓄設施以流入減流出的時間積分決定蓄水變化，最大入流量並不單獨決定所需庫容。下游高水位可能限制排水，水位與可用庫容也不是固定比例；需同時檢查初始蓄水、泵站可用性與洪水歷線的時序。~Storage change is the time integral of inflow minus outflow, so peak inflow alone cannot determine required capacity. High downstream levels can restrict discharge, and level is not always proportional to volume. Initial occupancy, pump availability and hydrograph timing must be assessed together rather than assuming the facility starts empty with unrestricted outflow.',
'將入出流歷線與水位庫容曲線閉合，測試不同初始水位和下游回水，檢查流量資料的時間間隔。~Close inflow-outflow hydrographs against the level-volume curve, test initial levels and downstream backwater and check sampling intervals.',
'以日平均流量代替短時洪峰會低估最高水位，泵可用卻無法克服下游水頭也會造成錯誤出流假設。~Daily mean flow misses short peaks and underestimates maximum level; an available pump may still fail to discharge against the downstream head.',
'泵站名目排水量大於平均入流就不需要調蓄容積。~Nominal pumping above mean inflow eliminates the need for storage.',
'交付可重算的逐時水量帳，標記起始水位、泵狀態與邊界洪水；控制決策依核准模型和即時量測而非單段算式。~Deliver a reproducible time-step balance with initial level, pump state and boundary flood; control decisions use approved models and observations, not one interval.','storage')
topic('roof','地下大廳頂板與支承~Underground hall roofs and supports','頂板荷載傳遞~Roof load transfer',
'大型地下調壓或蓄水大廳的頂板把覆土和自身重量傳到柱牆，再傳給基礎；水壓改變時底板與頂板的作用也不同。單向條帶只是局部彎矩示例，柱網、沖切、框架拘束、基礎變形及施工回填順序都需要整體模型。~A large underground pressure-control or storage hall transfers overburden and self-weight through its roof into columns, walls and foundations. Changing water pressure affects roof and base differently. A one-way strip illustrates local bending only; column layout, punching, frame restraint, foundation movement and backfilling sequence require a global structural model.',
'核對柱網、板厚及回填紀錄，將柱軸力、板撓度與裂縫位置聯合判讀，不把單一應變點視為整體反應。~Check the column grid, slab thickness and backfill records; interpret column force, deflection and cracking together rather than treating one strain reading as global behaviour.',
'漏掉局部柱頭作用會在平均彎矩不大時仍低估沖切風險，差異沉陷則可能把荷載重新分配到少數支承。~Missing column-head effects underestimates punching despite modest mean bending, while differential settlement redistributes load to fewer supports.',
'頂板平均彎矩不大就不必檢查柱頭沖切及基礎差異。~Small mean roof bending eliminates column punching and differential foundation checks.',
'將條帶計算標為局部示範，另列整體框架、沖切和抗浮的證據需求，施工與水位階段各自核對荷載。~Label the strip calculation as local and list global frame, punching and flotation evidence separately, reconciling loads for each construction and water-level stage.','beam')
topic('shaftflow','豎井跌水與能量消散~Drop-shaft flow and energy dissipation','跌水位能通量~Drop potential-energy flux',
'水流進入豎井時把高程能轉成速度、紊流與壓力波動，空氣捲入和排氣路徑會改變流況。位能通量只能估計需處理的能量量級，不能由此直接求井壁衝擊壓；進流偏心、淹沒與下游回水需實體或數值水理驗證。~Flow entering a shaft converts elevation energy into velocity, turbulence and fluctuating pressure, while entrainment and ventilation change the regime. Potential-energy flux estimates the scale to be dissipated but cannot directly give wall impact pressure. Eccentric entry, submergence and downstream backwater require physical or numerical hydraulic validation.',
'同步量測進出流、水位、井內氣壓和局部壓力脈動，比較淹沒前後工況並檢查取樣頻率。~Synchronise flow, levels, internal air pressure and local pressure fluctuations, comparing submerged and free discharge with adequate sampling frequency.',
'忽略氣路阻塞會低估水位及壓力波動，僅用平均能量可能掩蓋局部衝擊和間歇流。~Ignoring a blocked air path underestimates level and pressure fluctuations; average energy can conceal local impact and intermittent flow.',
'跌水位能功率可直接當作豎井壁的均勻壓力。~Drop potential-energy power can be used directly as uniform shaft-wall pressure.',
'分開交付能量帳、局部壓力和通氣模型，任何流況切換都核對上下游與氣相邊界，不以提升機功率代替水理分析。~Deliver energy balance, local-pressure and ventilation models separately; check liquid and air boundaries at regime changes rather than substituting hoist-power calculations.','hydropower')
topic('levelvolume','水位基準與庫容誤差~Level datum and volume uncertainty','水位零點偏差~Level zero-point bias',
'調蓄控制依賴水位訊號，但壓力式水位計還受氣壓、密度與安裝高程影響。水位誤差乘局部面積可估計一階庫容偏差；若斷面變寬或分艙逐次連通，必須使用完整水位庫容曲線，而非假設全程固定面積。~Storage control depends on level signals, but pressure-based sensors are affected by air pressure, density and installation elevation. Level error times local area estimates first-order volume bias. Widening sections and sequentially connected compartments require the full level-volume relation rather than a constant area across the operating range.',
'用獨立水準點和人工水尺覆核感測器零點，逐一核對氣壓補償與不同水位的庫容曲線。~Check sensor zero against independent benchmarks and a staff gauge, verifying air-pressure compensation and the volume relation at several levels.',
'多支感測器共用錯誤高程可互相比對一致，卻一致高估剩餘庫容，使控制系統遲判水位上升。~Several sensors sharing a wrong datum can agree while overestimating remaining volume and delaying recognition of rising water.',
'多支水位計讀值相同就能排除共同零點偏差。~Matching readings from multiple sensors exclude a shared zero-point bias.',
'庫容表與水位計使用同一經覆核的高程版本，感測器更換後重驗轉換和警報邏輯，保留原始讀值。~Use one checked datum revision for volume tables and sensors; after replacement verify conversions and alarm logic while preserving raw readings.','levelbias')
topic('landuse','地下儲存與地面介面~Subsurface storage and surface interfaces','幾何等效面積~Geometric equivalent area',
'地下儲存可以重新分配地面用途，但洞室幾何投影不等於實際釋出的土地。出入口、消防、產品管線、地面製程與維修空間仍占用土地；將容量換算成等效面積只是一個比較基準，須保持高度、利用率和附屬設施範圍一致。~Underground storage changes how surface land is used, but cavern projection is not the actual land released. Access, firefighting, product pipelines, surface processing and maintenance still require space. Converting volume to an equivalent area provides a comparison metric only when height, utilisation and auxiliary-facility boundaries remain consistent.',
'把洞室、豎井與地面設施分層繪圖，核對容積與占地邊界，分別列幾何面積和實際可使用土地。~Map caverns, shafts and surface facilities separately, reconcile volume and footprint boundaries and distinguish geometric area from usable land.',
'只用容積除高度宣稱節省土地會漏掉必要配套，可能低估地面通道、維修和消防的空間需求。~Claiming land saving from volume divided by height omits essential facilities and understates access, maintenance and firefighting space.',
'地下容積除高度就是工程實際節省的地面土地。~Underground volume divided by height equals actual surface land saved.',
'比較方案時固定功能與配套範圍，將幾何指標標為假設，土地效益由完整總配置與營運需求判讀。~Fix function and auxiliary scope when comparing options, label geometric metrics as assumptions and assess land benefit from the full layout and operational requirements.','footprint')
topic('cavern','岩洞節理楔體與錨固~Cavern wedges and anchorage','楔體重力分擔~Wedge self-weight sharing',
'大跨岩洞的局部穩定常由節理交線形成的可動楔體控制，完整岩石強度高仍可能產生重力掉塊。均分重量只估計錨固受力量級，滑移方向、節理水壓、錨桿角度與黏結長度須另驗，不能假設所有構件同時等量受力。~Local stability of a wide cavern can be governed by removable wedges formed by joint intersections even when intact rock is strong. Equal weight sharing estimates anchorage force scale only. Sliding direction, joint pressure, anchor inclination and bond length require separate checks, and simultaneous equal mobilisation of every anchor cannot be assumed.',
'由掌子面和洞頂節理測繪重建三維塊體，配合錨桿試驗與伸長量檢查受力方向和有效錨固區。~Reconstruct three-dimensional blocks from face and roof mapping, combining anchor tests and extension measurements to check force direction and effective bonded zones.',
'節理延伸到錨固端後方可能使錨桿連同塊體移動，材料拉力試驗合格也不能證明岩體黏結可靠。~A joint behind the bonded zone can let anchor and block move together; passing steel tension tests does not prove reliable rock bond.',
'錨桿鋼材強度足夠就能排除岩洞楔體掉落。~Adequate anchor steel strength excludes cavern wedge falls.',
'錨固圖與三維節理模型連結，標示試驗代表性及未知延伸，幾何改變後由岩力設計者重驗失穩模式。~Link anchorage drawings to the three-dimensional joint model, state test representativeness and uncertain persistence, and reassess mechanisms when geometry changes.','wedge')
topic('containment','水力封存與共同高程~Hydraulic containment at a common datum','局部向內壓差~Local inward pressure difference',
'岩洞液體儲存可利用周圍地下水壓維持向洞內的水力梯度，但產品液柱、氣相壓力和不同高程都影響壓差。單一測點正壓差不證明整座岩洞封存；裂隙連通、操作水位、瞬變及水幕補注的空間分布須共同驗證。~Liquid storage in rock can use surrounding groundwater pressure to maintain an inward hydraulic gradient, but product head, gas pressure and elevation affect the difference. A positive value at one point does not prove containment of the entire cavern. Fracture connectivity, operating levels, transients and the spatial distribution of water replenishment require joint assessment.',
'將外側測壓、產品液位與氣壓換到同一高程和壓力基準，沿洞頂與側牆多點比較並觀察時間變化。~Convert external head, product level and gas pressure to one elevation and pressure reference, comparing multiple roof and wall locations over time.',
'漏計氣相表壓會高估向內梯度，低水頭裂隙即使離主要測點不遠也可能形成局部向外路徑。~Omitting gas gauge pressure overstates inward gradient; a low-head fracture near a main sensor can still create a local outward path.',
'一支測壓管的向內壓差為正就能證明全洞室封存。~Positive inward pressure at one piezometer proves whole-cavern containment.',
'封存評估交付共同高程壓力圖、裂隙模型與操作範圍，監測和水力試驗互驗，不能以單一靜壓式核准操作。~Containment assessment includes common-datum pressure maps, fracture models and operating bounds; monitoring and hydraulic tests corroborate each other beyond one static equation.','contain')
topic('inventory','儲存容量與產品庫存帳~Storage capacity and product inventory','可用庫存空間~Available inventory space',
'岩洞總幾何容積不等於可裝產品量，既有庫存、保留氣相及不可使用區域都需扣除。液體熱膨脹與密度使體積帳和質量帳不同，轉運時還要處理管線存量；簡單差額只適用同一溫度、同一邊界與明確保留空間。~Gross cavern volume is not the amount available for product: existing stock, vapour reserve and unusable regions must be deducted. Thermal expansion and density distinguish volume from mass balances, while transfers involve pipeline inventory. A simple difference applies only at the same temperature, within one boundary and with explicitly reserved space.',
'以液位容積表、溫度與密度重建庫存，將管線轉運量和洞室量分開，再閉合進出質量帳。~Reconstruct inventory from calibrated level-volume tables, temperature and density, separate pipeline and cavern volumes and close the inlet-outlet mass balance.',
'不同溫度的體積直接相減會產生假性損失，漏列氣相保留量則高估可用空間並扭曲排程。~Subtracting volumes at different temperatures creates apparent losses, while omitted vapour reserve overstates available space and distorts scheduling.',
'總幾何容積減目前液位體積就是所有狀態的裝填上限。~Gross volume minus current liquid volume is the filling limit under every condition.',
'庫存交付明列溫度基準、保留空間和管線邊界，操作上限以核准設計與程序為準，教材差額僅供帳目理解。~Inventory records state temperature reference, reserved space and pipeline boundary; approved design and procedures determine operating limits, while the classroom difference illustrates accounting.','inventory')
topic('fracturegrout','裂隙封水與試驗前後比較~Fracture sealing and before-after testing','同條件入流減量~Equal-condition inflow reduction',
'岩體灌漿意在改變連通裂隙的水力傳導，注入體積不等於留下的有效封水體積。比較前後入流必須保持壓力、水頭和試段邊界一致，否則自然衰減或排水重分配也會降低讀值；灌漿效果要由水力試驗、鄰孔反應和後續揭露共同驗證。~Rock grouting changes hydraulic conductance of connected fractures, and injected volume is not retained effective sealing volume. Before-and-after flow must use equal pressure, head and test boundaries; natural decay or redirected drainage can also reduce the reading. Hydraulic tests, neighbouring-hole response and later exposure jointly establish the interpretation rather than injection quantity alone.',
'重複相同水頭和試段長度的水力試驗，同步觀察鄰孔壓力與出水，保存注漿歷程和試驗時間。~Repeat tests at equal head and interval length, observe neighbouring pressure and flow and preserve injection histories and test timing.',
'注漿流入遠端裂隙或形成局部封口，可能使單孔出水減少但主水路仍連通；改變測試水頭也會造成假性改善。~Grout entering distant fractures or sealing only a collar can reduce one outlet while the main path remains connected; changed test head also creates apparent improvement.',
'單孔流量下降就能證明整個掌子面已永久封水。~Reduced flow at one hole proves permanent sealing of the entire face.',
'把注入量、同條件水力結果和未覆蓋區分開交付，任何封水判斷保留替代水路及後續確認需求，不以教材減量當現場允收。~Hand over injection quantity, equal-condition hydraulic results and untested areas separately, retaining alternative paths and follow-up checks rather than using classroom reduction as field acceptance.','flowreduction')
